00:38:18.780 --> 00:38:24.840
this treatment, this therapy approach. But&nbsp;
one of the most potent tools in the box of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:38:24.840 --> 00:38:30.120
CBTI therapist is what we call sleep restriction&nbsp;
therapy, which sounds paradoxical. I come or you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:38:30.120 --> 00:38:34.140
come to me and let's say I'm your sleep clinician,&nbsp;
