00:40:08.880 --> 00:40:14.640
you've just got so much sleepiness built up,&nbsp;
so much adenosine that hasn't been removed.&nbsp;

00:40:14.640 --> 00:40:20.580
So we do a diluted version of that in CBTI with&nbsp;
