00:40:34.080 --> 00:40:42.720
but now push it — go to 2:00 a.m. or 2:30 a.m. or&nbsp;
let's say 3:00 a.m. but you still wake up at the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:40:42.720 --> 00:40:47.520
same time. So where we restrict your sleep&nbsp;
is not by having you wake up any earlier,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:40:47.520 --> 00:40:51.840
which is kind of miserable. And most&nbsp;
people, people feel it's easier to go&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:40:51.840 --> 00:40:57.660
to bed later than wake up any earlier.
So we start there, we limit the amount&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:40:57.660 --> 00:41:01.740
of time that you are in bed and we restrict&nbsp;
it down to maybe six hours or five hours,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:41:02.460 --> 00:41:08.460
and the next day you're going to feel miserable.&nbsp;
You've only been in bed for five hours.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:41:09.300 --> 00:41:13.560
But what happens is that as long as you&nbsp;
