00:41:52.680 --> 00:41:57.660
is their alarm going off at 8:00 a.m., and for&nbsp;
the first time ever, they have slept all the way&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:41:57.660 --> 00:42:04.260
through from front to back. Now in that example,&nbsp;
