00:42:05.220 --> 00:42:10.500
and they're now sleeping a solid five hours.&nbsp;
But remember that's better than where they were.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:42:10.500 --> 00:42:14.820
They were in bed for eight hours and they were&nbsp;
