00:58:58.920 --> 00:59:05.820
key different functions like emotional therapy&nbsp;
and emotional first aid. It supports creativity.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:59:06.480 --> 00:59:13.740
And I've worried myself, is it hubris for me&nbsp;
to think that I should then take the reins and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:59:13.740 --> 00:59:19.980
get into the driver's cockpit and start steering&nbsp;
the vehicle, rather than just allowing whatever&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:59:19.980 --> 00:59:24.780
Mother Nature thinks should happen for me?
I don't know. The only other strike against&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:59:24.780 --> 00:59:28.800
lucid dreaming, and I don't think it's a big one&nbsp;
and I don't think it's anything to be worried&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:59:28.800 --> 00:59:33.960
about, when you survey people and when we've&nbsp;
