01:50:00.840 --> 01:50:06.420
there's anything that is currently, and this might&nbsp;
make you uncomfortable, but I'll do it if there's&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:50:06.420 --> 01:50:12.480
anything that is currently considered along the&nbsp;
lines of charlatan science that you think might&nbsp;&nbsp;

