is you check your watch, you check your phone,&nbsp;
because you're trying to look to the time. Because&nbsp;&nbsp;

02:00:43.080 --> 02:00:48.120
when you sleep, you lose all conscious perception&nbsp;
of time. You've got no idea. And that's the reason&nbsp;&nbsp;

02:00:48.120 --> 02:00:52.440
that you check, "How long have I been asleep?"
Well, why don't you know? I don't know,&nbsp;&nbsp;

02:00:52.440 --> 02:00:57.900
because I don't track sleep time when&nbsp;
I'm sleeping. However, when you dream,&nbsp;&nbsp;

02:00:57.900 --> 02:01:03.780
something different happens. And maybe you've had&nbsp;
this experience. I certainly have, and many people&nbsp;&nbsp;

02:01:03.780 --> 02:01:09.480
have. Your alarm goes off, and you have a snooze&nbsp;
