is time dilation. That it's during dream&nbsp;
sleep, that we almost stretch time out.&nbsp;

02:01:42.840 --> 02:01:49.380
What would be the neurobiological basis of that?&nbsp;
Well, I think it could be some of this rat work&nbsp;&nbsp;

02:01:49.380 --> 02:01:56.880
that suggests that perhaps during dream sleep,&nbsp;
the brain slows down the recapitulation of time.&nbsp;&nbsp;

02:01:57.600 --> 02:02:03.360
And you can have all sorts of fun with this idea.&nbsp;
Christopher Nolan was wise enough to consult some&nbsp;&nbsp;

02:02:03.360 --> 02:02:10.680
