Tim Ferriss: Wow. Yeah.&nbsp;

02:05:37.577 --> 02:05:42.720
Dr. Matthew Walker: And I think what's happening&nbsp;
is that the insular cortex has some interesting&nbsp;&nbsp;

02:05:42.720 --> 02:05:47.640
changes. We see it changing in its activity&nbsp;
